From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:18:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] windows.applicationmodel: PropertySet events and views,
 Package identity, CoreApplication view

PropertySet raises MapChanged (inserted, changed, removed, reset) to registered
handlers, gives GetView snapshots (IMapView, iterable) and iterates its
IKeyValuePair entries. Package.Current has an Id (name = image name, 1.0.0.0,
architecture of the build), IsFramework false, empty Dependencies, and
InstalledLocation is the real Windows.Storage.StorageFolder of the image
directory (windows.storage). CoreApplication.GetCurrentView returns the main
view (no CoreWindow); Run reports APPMODEL_ERROR_NO_PACKAGE. GetIids / class
name / trust level for every factory and object.

